    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Tier 3 — Gnostic</strong></p><p><strong>“They can’t lie to me anymore.”</strong></p><p>You recognize Stealth instantly — not by tells, but by structure. Falsehoods do not hold their shape around you.</p><p><strong>Tactical (Character Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>reroll the lowest die on <strong>Insight</strong> checks to detect Stealth</li><li>You cannot be magically <strong>charmed</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Strategic (Faction Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>Once per Scenario, your faction may automatically ignore a single Stealth-based complication without spending OPs</li></ul><p><strong>Cost:</strong> immunity to manipulation also erodes comforting ambiguity. Expect personal distance, reduced tolerance for pageantry, and situations where your honesty becomes socially expensive.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"gnosT3\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Ignore Stealth</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Scenario &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Strategic &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Automatically ignore a single Stealth-based complication without spending OPs.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
